@startuml
title R1 - Rental reservation (proposed)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty description
[*] --> Pending : submit
Pending --> Confirmed : confirm [eligible + quota + atomic claim]
Pending --> [*] : reject / no record persisted
Confirmed --> Active : pickup [owner + eligible + t < expiry]\n/ start Trip; release source occupancy
Confirmed --> Cancelled : cancel [owner + t < expiry]\n/ release claim only
Confirmed --> Cancelled : resource invalidated\n/ keep parked occupancy
Confirmed --> Expired : expire [t >= expiry]\n/ release claim only
Active --> Completed : return [Hub accepts]\n/ finish Trip; occupy destination
Active --> Completed : verified recovery [operator + Hub accepts]\n/ Trip INCIDENT_ABORTED
Active : incident / record flag, keep Trip open
Active : overdue / mark Trip OVERDUE
Active : full-Hub return / reject, keep state
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Expired --> [*]
note right of Pending
  Transient request, not a durable booking.
end note
note left of Active
  No cancel or pickup-deadline expiry.
  Retry returns existing Trip / receipt.
  Completed does not mean Vehicle Available.
end note
@enduml
